   193	    - Inside each frame is one 4-connected single-color object with at least one enclosed black hole, and it is not already touching the marker side.
   194	
   195	    Rule:
   196	    - For each frame, identify the marker side and translate the entire inner object straight toward that side until its bounding box is flush with the frame's inner edge on that side.
